# Project Pre-Push Checks

Inspect the outgoing diff, applicable instructions, and established validation entry points. Map each changed behavior or contract to the smallest relevant check. Run safe local checks from narrow to broad, including documentation and metadata checks where applicable. Do not perform production or external side effects. Report commands and observed outcomes exactly; skipped, blocked, or unavailable checks are not passes.
